{"lang":"zh-CN","summary":"Navigation: 工具调用与MCP MOC","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"工具调用的 Schema 设计最佳实践\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"工具调用与MCP\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> fundamental\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> high\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/工具调用\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/fundamental</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/04-%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%8EMCP/%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%8EMCP%20MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/04-%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%8EMCP/%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%8EMCP%20MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">工具调用与MCP MOC</a></p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"问题\" dir=\"auto\">问题</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">如何设计高质量的 JSON Schema 工具定义，让 LLM 准确理解和调用工具？</p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"答案\" dir=\"auto\">答案</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">工具 Schema 的设计质量直接决定了 LLM 调用的准确性。description 是模型判断的唯一依据，Schema 设计不是\"能跑就行\"，而是需要精心设计的工程问题。</p>\n<h3 data-heading=\"Schema 核心结构\" dir=\"auto\">Schema 核心结构</h3>\n<pre class=\"language-json\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-json is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token property\">\"type\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"function\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"token property\">\"function\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"token property\">\"name\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"tool_name\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"token property\">\"description\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"清晰、具体的工具功能描述，包含适用场景和不适用场景\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"token property\">\"parameters\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n            <span class=\"token property\">\"type\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"object\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token property\">\"properties\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n                <span class=\"token property\">\"param1\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n                    <span class=\"token property\">\"type\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"string\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                    <span class=\"token property\">\"description\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"参数含义、格式、示例值\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                    <span class=\"token property\">\"enum\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"可选的枚举值\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n                <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n            <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token property\">\"required\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"param1\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h3 data-heading=\"设计最佳实践\" dir=\"auto\">设计最佳实践</h3>\n<h4 data-heading=\"1. description 必须精准具体\" dir=\"auto\">1. description 必须精准具体</h4>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token comment\"># ❌ 坏示例 - 描述含糊</span>\n<span class=\"token string\">\"description\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"获取天气\"</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># ✅ 好示例 - 精确描述边界</span>\n<span class=\"token string\">\"description\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"查询指定中国大陆城市的实时天气，包含气温、天气状况、风向风速。不支持查询历史天气或未来预报。不支持国外城市。\"</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h4 data-heading=\"2. 参数说明要包含约束和示例\" dir=\"auto\">2. 参数说明要包含约束和示例</h4>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token string\">\"properties\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"city\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"type\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"string\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"description\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"城市中文名称，如'北京''上海'。不要带'市'后缀，不要传省份+城市组合。\"</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"date\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"type\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"string\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"description\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"查询日期，格式YYYY-MM-DD，如'2024-01-15'。仅支持今天和明天。\"</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h4 data-heading=\"3. 用 enum 限制参数取值范围\" dir=\"auto\">3. 用 enum 限制参数取值范围</h4>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token string\">\"unit\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"type\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"string\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"enum\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"celsius\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"fahrenheit\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"description\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"温度单位，默认celsius\"</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h4 data-heading=\"4. 明确标注 required 字段\" dir=\"auto\">4. 明确标注 required 字段</h4>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token string\">\"required\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"city\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 必填参数</span>\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 可选参数不要放在 required 中，让模型知道可以不传</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h4 data-heading=\"5. 避免工具职责重叠\" dir=\"auto\">5. 避免工具职责重叠</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">多个工具功能相近时，模型会根据名字猜测，产生误调用。必须明确区分：</p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token comment\"># ❌ 坏示例 - 两个工具职责不清</span>\n<span class=\"token string\">\"name\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"search\"</span>        <span class=\"token comment\"># description: \"搜索信息\"</span>\n<span class=\"token string\">\"name\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"query_db\"</span>      <span class=\"token comment\"># description: \"查询数据库\"</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># ✅ 好示例 - 职责明确分离</span>\n<span class=\"token string\">\"name\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"web_search\"</span>    <span class=\"token comment\"># description: \"在互联网上搜索公开信息，适用于查新闻、百科、实时资讯。不适用于查内部系统数据。\"</span>\n<span class=\"token string\">\"name\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"query_orders\"</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># description: \"查询内部订单管理系统的订单数据，需要订单号或用户ID作为输入。\"</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h4 data-heading=\"6. 控制工具数量和单次可用数量\" dir=\"auto\">6. 控制工具数量和单次可用数量</h4>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">总工具数建议不超过 20-30 个</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">单次请求中给模型看到的工具不超过 8 个（避免上下文过长、选择困难）</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">按场景动态选择工具子集，而非一次性暴露所有工具</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-heading=\"完整的高质量 Schema 示例\" dir=\"auto\">完整的高质量 Schema 示例</h3>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">tools <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"type\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"function\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"function\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"name\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"create_bug_ticket\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"description\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"在缺陷管理系统中创建 Bug 工单。适用于用户反馈线上问题、测试发现缺陷等场景。不支持创建需求或任务工单。\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"parameters\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"type\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"object\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"properties\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n                <span class=\"token string\">\"title\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n                    <span class=\"token string\">\"type\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"string\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                    <span class=\"token string\">\"description\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Bug 标题，简洁描述问题，如'支付接口返回500错误'\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                    <span class=\"token string\">\"maxLength\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">100</span>\n                <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                <span class=\"token string\">\"severity\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n                    <span class=\"token string\">\"type\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"string\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                    <span class=\"token string\">\"enum\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"P0-紧急\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"P1-严重\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"P2-一般\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"P3-轻微\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                    <span class=\"token string\">\"description\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"严重程度。线上故障选P0，核心功能不可用选P1，一般缺陷选P2，UI问题选P3。\"</span>\n                <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                <span class=\"token string\">\"reproduce_steps\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n                    <span class=\"token string\">\"type\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"string\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                    <span class=\"token string\">\"description\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"复现步骤，用1.2.3.格式列出。至少包含操作步骤、输入数据、期望结果、实际结果。\"</span>\n                <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                <span class=\"token string\">\"reporter\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n                    <span class=\"token string\">\"type\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"string\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                    <span class=\"token string\">\"description\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"报告人工号，格式EMP开头，如'EMP00123'\"</span>\n                <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n            <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"required\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"title\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"severity\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"reproduce_steps\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h2 data-heading=\"延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">延伸追问</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Q: Schema 写得越详细越好吗？</strong><br>\nA: 不是。过长描述会增加上下文噪声，消耗更多 token。关键是\"清晰、互斥、可校验\"——每个字段要有业务含义，工具之间职责不重叠。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Q: 工具数量很多时怎么办？</strong><br>\nA: 采用工具检索机制——先用 TF-IDF/BM25/向量检索筛选出最相关的 K 个工具，再交给 LLM 选择。类似 RAG 的思路做 Tool Selection。</p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"常见误区\" dir=\"auto\">常见误区</h2>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>误区</strong>：description 随便写，模型能猜出来。<br>\n<strong>纠正</strong>：description 是模型判断的唯一依据，写得不清楚模型就会\"瞎猜\"。</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>误区</strong>：所有工具一次性暴露给模型。<br>\n<strong>纠正</strong>：工具太多会降低选择准确率，建议按场景动态筛选。</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>误区</strong>：Schema 只是形式，不影响调用质量。<br>\n<strong>纠正</strong>：Schema 质量直接决定工具选择准确率和参数正确率，是工程落地的关键。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>","headings":[]}